    {
      "subId": "7500003",
      "subQuestName": "破坏岩石，救出幼兽",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750000301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750000301": {
            "id": "750000301",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#嗯，那么小家伙的名字就叫{TMPVALUE(TMP_VALUE_KEY_TYPE_LITTLE_DRILL_TMP_NAME)}咯？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7500005",
      "subQuestName": "(test)test解救小恐龙timeline$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750000501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750000501": {
            "id": "750000501",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我再想想…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000502"
            ]
          },
          "750000502": {
            "id": "750000502",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "好哦，毕竟名字是很重要的，还是再仔细考虑一下吧！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7500006",
      "subQuestName": "与幼兽对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750000601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750000601": {
            "id": "750000601",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "啊…小家伙，你没事吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000602"
            ]
          },
          "750000602": {
            "id": "750000602",
            "speakerId": 21619,
            "speakerName": "小家伙？",
            "text": "呜…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000603"
            ]
          },
          "750000603": {
            "id": "750000603",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "怎、怎么了，看上去有点不太舒服的样子，咦，是尾巴吗，刚才从那个罩子掉下来的时候摔到了尾巴？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000604"
            ]
          },
          "750000604": {
            "id": "750000604",
            "speakerId": 21619,
            "speakerName": "小家伙？",
            "text": "呜…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000605"
            ]
          },
          "750000605": {
            "id": "750000605",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "如果能包扎一下…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000606"
            ]
          },
          "750000606": {
            "id": "750000606",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嘿嘿，这就轮到我出场的时候啦…你的背包里满满当当的，关键时刻找个东西也得找半天。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000607"
            ]
          },
          "750000607": {
            "id": "750000607",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "就用「派蒙应急小背包」里的这条丝巾稍微包扎一下吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000608"
            ]
          },
          "750000608": {
            "id": "750000608",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你的背包到底在哪…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000609"
            ]
          },
          "750000609": {
            "id": "750000609",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "哼，当然是藏在了不能随便被发现的地方…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000610"
            ]
          },
          "750000610": {
            "id": "750000610",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸呀，这丝巾你到底要不要用啦！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000611"
            ]
          },
          "750000611": {
            "id": "750000611",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "要用的，谢谢派蒙。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000612"
            ]
          },
          "750000612": {
            "id": "750000612",
            "speakerId": 21619,
            "speakerName": "小家伙？",
            "text": "嗯？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000613"
            ]
          },
          "750000613": {
            "id": "750000613",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "小家伙，不要动哦…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000614"
            ]
          },
          "750000614": {
            "id": "750000614",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#嘿嘿，{NICKNAME}，没想到它还挺乖的呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000615"
            ]
          },
          "750000615": {
            "id": "750000615",
            "speakerId": 21619,
            "speakerName": "小家伙？",
            "text": "呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000616"
            ]
          },
          "750000616": {
            "id": "750000616",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "这样就行了吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000617"
            ]
          },
          "750000617": {
            "id": "750000617",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "怎么样，小家伙，觉得好一些了吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000618"
            ]
          },
          "750000618": {
            "id": "750000618",
            "speakerId": 21619,
            "speakerName": "小家伙？",
            "text": "呀…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000619"
            ]
          },
          "750000619": {
            "id": "750000619",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "好了，小家伙看上去也很精神…真是松了口气，不过，你到底为什么被关进了那样一个罩子里呀？还有，还有那些兽境猎犬…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000620"
            ]
          },
          "750000620": {
            "id": "750000620",
            "speakerId": 21619,
            "speakerName": "小家伙？",
            "text": "嗯？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000621"
            ]
          },
          "750000621": {
            "id": "750000621",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你也不知道呀，就算你知道，你「呀啊呀啊」的我们也听不懂倒是了…不过，小家伙，我们把你救出来了，你可以回家啦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000622"
            ]
          },
          "750000622": {
            "id": "750000622",
            "speakerId": 21619,
            "speakerName": "小家伙？",
            "text": "嗯？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000623"
            ]
          },
          "750000623": {
            "id": "750000623",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "咦，难道不知道自己家在哪吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000624"
            ]
          },
          "750000624": {
            "id": "750000624",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那你的亲人，啊，难道，刚才的大家伙…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000625"
            ]
          },
          "750000625": {
            "id": "750000625",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#那怎么办，{NICKNAME}…总不能把它一个人、呃一个家伙丢在这里吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000626"
            ]
          },
          "750000626": {
            "id": "750000626",
            "speakerId": 21619,
            "speakerName": "小家伙？",
            "text": "呜…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000627"
            ]
          },
          "750000627": {
            "id": "750000627",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "倒是可以先跟着我们…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000628"
            ]
          },
          "750000628": {
            "id": "750000628",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "也是啦，说不定到了纳塔，就能找到小家伙的家人了…不过我们之前还没看到过跟小家伙一样的…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000629"
            ]
          },
          "750000629": {
            "id": "750000629",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "啊，「受龙…所选者…」，难道…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000630"
            ]
          },
          "750000630": {
            "id": "750000630",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嗯…你说似乎看到了这样的话？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000631"
            ]
          },
          "750000631": {
            "id": "750000631",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这么说来，纳塔是龙的国度吧，咦，难道，小家伙也是…龙？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000632"
            ]
          },
          "750000632": {
            "id": "750000632",
            "speakerId": 21619,
            "speakerName": "小家伙？",
            "text": "唔…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000633"
            ]
          },
          "750000633": {
            "id": "750000633",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这么说来看上去确实和龙蜥挺像的，都有…两条腿和一条尾巴。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000634"
            ]
          },
          "750000634": {
            "id": "750000634",
            "speakerId": 21619,
            "speakerName": "小家伙？",
            "text": "嗯？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000635"
            ]
          },
          "750000635": {
            "id": "750000635",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "让它跟着我们是没问题啦…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000636"
            ]
          },
          "750000636": {
            "id": "750000636",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "不过得问问它同不同意。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000637"
            ]
          },
          "750000637": {
            "id": "750000637",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "说的也是呢，小家伙，你愿意跟我们一起旅行吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000638"
            ]
          },
          "750000638": {
            "id": "750000638",
            "speakerId": 21619,
            "speakerName": "小家伙？",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000639"
            ]
          },
          "750000639": {
            "id": "750000639",
            "speakerId": 21619,
            "speakerName": "小家伙？",
            "text": "呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000640"
            ]
          },
          "750000640": {
            "id": "750000640",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#嘿嘿，小家伙同意啦。对了，我是派蒙！{M#他}{F#她}是{NICKNAME}！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000641"
            ]
          },
          "750000641": {
            "id": "750000641",
            "speakerId": 21619,
            "speakerName": "小家伙？",
            "text": "啵嗯？呀…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000642"
            ]
          },
          "750000642": {
            "id": "750000642",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "对了，小家伙也得有个名字…让我想想，看你颜色黄黄黑黑的，不如就叫你「土豆饼」吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000643"
            ]
          },
          "750000643": {
            "id": "750000643",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "土豆饼？",
            "text": "呜…呜…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000645"
            ]
          },
          "750000645": {
            "id": "750000645",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "「在其他地方就不受欢迎」的意思是吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000647"
            ]
          },
          "750000647": {
            "id": "750000647",
            "speakerId": 21619,
            "speakerName": "小家伙？",
            "text": "呜…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000648"
            ]
          },
          "750000648": {
            "id": "750000648",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#你想让{NICKNAME}给你取名字？这家伙的取名品味…我可不好说哦。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7500007",
      "subQuestName": "为小家伙取一个超棒的名字！",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750000701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750000701": {
            "id": "750000701",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那，要给小家伙取一个什么样的名字呢？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7500009",
      "subQuestName": "与龙伙伴对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750000901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750000901": {
            "id": "750000901",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}啊，你以后的名字就叫作{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}了哦，小家伙！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000902"
            ]
          },
          "750000902": {
            "id": "750000902",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000903"
            ]
          },
          "750000903": {
            "id": "750000903",
            "speakerId": 21460,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "…呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000904"
            ]
          },
          "750000904": {
            "id": "750000904",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#看来它很喜欢这个名字呢…嘿嘿，希望在纳塔能够解开你身上的谜团…对了，还有{NICKNAME}突然就能够钻到龙身体里的事…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000905"
            ]
          },
          "750000905": {
            "id": "750000905",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#刚才都忘了问了，{NICKNAME}你突然就变成了龙，没出什么事吧，有没有觉得难受？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000907",
              "750000909"
            ]
          },
          "750000907": {
            "id": "750000907",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "晕龙是什么啦！还有空开玩笑，下次不理你了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000910"
            ]
          },
          "750000910": {
            "id": "750000910",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#不过，{NICKNAME}，我之前可没听说纳塔有人能够变成龙…感觉有点怪。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000911"
            ]
          },
          "750000911": {
            "id": "750000911",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "真是的，才刚到纳塔，感觉就发生了这么多事…好了，接下来的问题就是，我们要怎么出去呢？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750000912"
            ]
          },
          "750000912": {
            "id": "750000912",
            "speakerId": 21460,
